{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY &amp; WORLD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first expedition thought they were changing the world. Pinnacle Point would be the breakthrough, the place where the known rules of physics no longer seemed to apply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island gave them just enough to believe that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aron saw the cracks early. He felt it in his gut that something was off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His brother didn't agree, he always thought he knew better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So Aron left, leaving him behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the dreams won't stop. Neither will the voice that sounds too much like his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island didn't forget, and Aron can't either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.poster.avif?t=1763835221\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.webm?t=1763835221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/df6e6319ee32efad88848252dce4c0c8.mp4?t=1763835221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay with Modern elements:</strong>\u00a0Navigate the island with a blend of exploration, puzzle-solving, and strategic combat. Resources are scarce, and encounters with the grotesque inhabitants are a tense, life-or-death struggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong>\u00a0A cinematic blend of dynamic and fixed camera angles enhances the suspenseful, immersive experience. Dense fog, flickering lights, and unsettling sounds keep you constantly on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong>\u00a0Discover the island\u2019s dark secrets through cryptic notes, fragmented memories, and environmental cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Horror:</strong>\u00a0The line between reality and nightmare blurs as you delve deeper into the true nature of the island, your brother\u2019s fate and the fate of those who sought to control it. Atmospheric sound design and meticulously crafted environments build a world steeped in horror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.poster.avif?t=1763835221\" width=610 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.webm?t=1763835221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/extras/59247e2e239befae38c9d17d201c2fe9.mp4?t=1763835221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is actively being worked on. Gameplay, screenshots or trailers might be subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875410?t=1763835221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875410?t=1763835221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875410/319d5910f0d9261bd59547c13186019c54581a69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763835221","capsule_i